{"code":200,"results":[{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/MattiaMerenda2/status/2105271825513009546","id":"2105271825513009546","text":"Bignnews for compositing","raw_text":{"text":"Bignnews for compositing","display_text_range":[0,24],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"MattiaMerenda2","url":"https://x.com/MattiaMerenda2","id":"1498959067003469830","followers":1885,"following":1514,"likes":85218,"media_count":852,"statuses":8550,"name":"Mattia Merenda","description":"3D VFX Generalist - Houdini FX Artist\n\nfor info : mattia.merenda.freelance@gmail.com","raw_description":{"text":"3D VFX Generalist - Houdini FX Artist\n\nfor info : mattia.merenda.freelance@gmail.com","facets":[]},"location":"Prague, Czech Republic","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1498959067003469830/1757306290","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041860228984270854/frkhxLsJ_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed Mar 02 09:51:49 +0000 2022","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":1,"reposts":0,"likes":30,"bookmarks":19,"quotes":0,"embed_card":"player","created_at":"Wed Sep 30 12:21:31 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790770891,"views":1974,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"quote":{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751","id":"2105192577850806751","text":"I am happy to share the results of my first serious attempt at training a model based on the insane Marigold V2 by @AntonObukhov1 and his team! \n\nAI generated depth of field has been historically unusable, lacking detail and temporal coherence. \nMarigoldV2 solved the detail part and I set out to solve the coherence. \n\nThrough a series of targeted training passes focusing on large scale morphing and flicker first, I then moved to boundary and edge detection before finally squeezing back in the detail using Marigold V2s Sink Loss technique\n\nThe end result speaks for itself and while still not perfect, I have learned tons and have set out to expand my personal library of high quality CGI, photoreal scenes so I can do a much larger training run in future. \n\nTraining was completed over 400 H200 Hours.","raw_text":{"text":"I am happy to share the results of my first serious attempt at training a model based on the insane Marigold V2 by @AntonObukhov1 and his team! \n\nAI generated depth of field has been historically unusable, lacking detail and temporal coherence. \nMarigoldV2 solved the detail part and I set out to solve the coherence. \n\nThrough a series of targeted training passes focusing on large scale morphing and flicker first, I then moved to boundary and edge detection before finally squeezing back in the detail using Marigold V2s Sink Loss technique\n\nThe end result speaks for itself and while still not perfect, I have learned tons and have set out to expand my personal library of high quality CGI, photoreal scenes so I can do a much larger training run in future. \n\nTraining was completed over 400 H200 Hours.","display_text_range":[0,807],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[115,129],"original":"AntonObukhov1","id":"1257961662331707392"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105191464934461440","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105191827104321536","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105192035091443712","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105192144394964992","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.c