ymous.co/anton-obukhov","display":"admonymous.co/anton-obukhov"},{"type":"url","indices":[110,133],"original":"https://t.co/uusqHd6fIn","replacement":"https://github.com/sponsors/toshas","display":"github.com/sponsors/toshas"}]},"location":"Zurich","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1257961662331707392/1772749822","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029681260017164288/D4QlsbzJ_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed May 06 09:14:49 +0000 2020","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://obukhov.ai","display_url":"obukhov.ai"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":0,"reposts":2,"likes":16,"bookmarks":12,"quotes":0,"embed_card":"player","created_at":"Wed Sep 30 07:21:08 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790752868,"views":2384,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"media":{},"quote":{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751","id":"2105192577850806751","text":"I am happy to share the results of my first serious attempt at training a model based on the insane Marigold V2 by @AntonObukhov1 and his team! \n\nAI generated depth of field has been historically unusable, lacking detail and temporal coherence. \nMarigoldV2 solved the detail part and I set out to solve the coherence. \n\nThrough a series of targeted training passes focusing on large scale morphing and flicker first, I then moved to boundary and edge detection before finally squeezing back in the detail using Marigold V2s Sink Loss technique\n\nThe end result speaks for itself and while still not perfect, I have learned tons and have set out to expand my personal library of high quality CGI, photoreal scenes so I can do a much larger training run in future. \n\nTraining was completed over 400 H200 Hours.","raw_text":{"text":"I am happy to share the results of my first serious attempt at training a model based on the insane Marigold V2 by @AntonObukhov1 and his team! \n\nAI generated depth of field has been historically unusable, lacking detail and temporal coherence. \nMarigoldV2 solved the detail part and I set out to solve the coherence. \n\nThrough a series of targeted training passes focusing on large scale morphing and flicker first, I then moved to boundary and edge detection before finally squeezing back in the detail using Marigold V2s Sink Loss technique\n\nThe end result speaks for itself and while still not perfect, I have learned tons and have set out to expand my personal library of high quality CGI, photoreal scenes so I can do a much larger training run in future. \n\nTraining was completed over 400 H200 Hours.","display_text_range":[0,807],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[115,129],"original":"AntonObukhov1","id":"1257961662331707392"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105191464934461440","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105191827104321536","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105192035091443712","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2105192144394964992","display":"pic.x.com/kex2XfgqnI","original":"https://t.co/kex2XfgqnI","replacement":"https://x.com/breakdown_art/status/2105192577850806751/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"breakdown_art","url":"https://x.com/breakdown_art","id":"2070073164445646848","followers":63,"following":22,"likes":8,"media_count":8,"statuses":32,"name":"Breakdown","description":"Breakdown is an upcoming state of the art AI film editor designed to revolutionise film production.","raw_description":{"text":"